#ASSERT `the percentage of the annual premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` (YMD 2026 1 1) (`add months` (YMD 2026 1 1) 6) EQUALS 60
-- src:280 | Từ 6 đến 9 tháng 90% phí bảo hiểm năm
#ASSERT `the percentage of the annual premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` (YMD 2026 1 1) (`add months` (YMD 2026 1 1) 6 PLUS 15) EQUALS 90
#ASSERT `the percentage of the annual premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` (YMD 2026 1 1) (`add months` (YMD 2026 1 1) 9) EQUALS 90
-- src:281 | Trên 9 tháng 100% phí bảo hiểm năm
#ASSERT `the percentage of the annual premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` (YMD 2026 1 1) (`add months` (YMD 2026 1 1) 9 PLUS 15) EQUALS 100

-- the premium kept is that percentage of the ANNUAL premium (12,000,000 here)
#ASSERT `the premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` `the Schedule` (YMD 2026 2 15) EQUALS 3600000
#ASSERT `the premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` `the Schedule` (YMD 2026 5 1) EQUALS 7200000
#ASSERT `the premium kept when the Insured ends the cover on` `the Schedule` (YMD 2026 10 15) EQUALS 12000000
